OL,3,GNEWSAHospital heroes reunited with baby
OL,4,Aborn in car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe birth of any child is memorable but
OL,7,FKatie Good says she will never forget
OL,8,Fthe moment her son arrived unexpectedly
OL,9,Fin a hospital car park.
OL,11,FNow Katie and partner James Gingell, of
OL,12,FPeterborough, have been reunited with
OL,13,Fthe two hospital workers who came to
OL,14,Ftheir aid as Oliver was born outside
OL,15,FHinchingbrooke Hospital in Huntingdon,
OL,16,FCambridgeshire.
OL,18,FHealthcare assistant Sam Craigie and
OL,19,Finterim deputy divisional nursing
OL,20,Fdirector Ana Jardim happened to be
OL,21,Foutside and rushed to help when they
OL,22,Fheard screams.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
