OL,3,GNEWSAHospital heroes reunited with baby
OL,4,Aborn in car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie, 38, said: "We've thought about
OL,7,Fthem so often over the last few months,
OL,8,Fso having the opportunity to thank them
OL,9,Fin person was incredibly emotional and
OL,10,Fsomething we'll never forget."
